  "description": "The Canfield Lithium V1 and V2 (2020–2025) established the foundation of Canfield’s long-travel 29er platform. Built around CBF™ suspension and modern enduro geometry, these first-generation Lithium frames delivered high-speed stability, efficient pedaling, and confident descending performance that continues to define the platform today.\n\nLaunched in 2020, the Lithium marked the expansion of the CBF™ suspension system into a dedicated long-travel 29” chassis. The objective was simple: build a big-terrain 29er that climbed efficiently, remained planted at speed, and maintained the balanced ride character riders expect from Canfield.\n\nThe Lithium was engineered to maintain traction under acceleration while remaining composed through repeated impacts and steep descents.\n\nIt climbed with efficiency and descended with deliberate confidence, making it a versatile long-travel platform for enduro, bike park, and big-mountain riding.\n\nLithium V1 and V2 geometry reflected progressive enduro thinking while maintaining Canfield’s balance-first design approach.\n\nV2 maintained identical geometry and suspension characteristics to V1, with minor production refinements and updated colorways. Ride feel remained intentionally consistent across both versions.\n\nThe Lithium V1 and V2 represent the first generation of the Lithium platform. Rather than a one-off model, these bikes established the geometry, suspension behavior, and ride identity that continues to evolve in future generations of the Lithium.\n\nFor replacement hardware, bearings, and service components specific to this platform:\n\nLithium Service Parts Collection",
